---
%% HAND-CURATED. Air-gapped — 2 authorized engineers required, tjtjboth must sign ceremony log.
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant SecurityEngineerOne
    participant SecurityEngineerTwo
    participant AirGappedWorkstation
    participant YubiHSM
    participant KMS
    participant OtaService
    participant FleetDevices
    participant PostgreSQL

    Note over SecurityEngineerOne,FleetDevices: Pre-ceremony (1 week before)
    SecurityEngineerOne->>SecurityEngineerOne: verify backup key exists
    alt backup_key_missing
        SecurityEngineerOne->>PostgreSQL: INSERT key_rotation_log {status='failed', notes='backup key missing'}
        Note over SecurityEngineerOne: ABORT — no rotation without backup key
    else success
        SecurityEngineerOne->>FleetDevices: confirm firmware accepts tjtjboth keys (sys-09 telemetry sweep)
    end

    Note over SecurityEngineerOne,FleetDevices: Key Generation (air-gapped)
    SecurityEngineerOne->>AirGappedWorkstation: boot from read-only media
    SecurityEngineerTwo->>AirGappedWorkstation: witness + co-sign (tjtjboth engineers required)
    AirGappedWorkstation->>YubiHSM: generate ECDSA P-256 keypair
    YubiHSM-->>AirGappedWorkstation: public key exported (private NEVER leaves HSM)
    AirGappedWorkstation->>AirGappedWorkstation: seal HSM in tamper-evident bag
    alt hsm_seal_check_failed
        Note over SecurityEngineerOne: abort ceremony — tamper evidence broken
    end

    Note over SecurityEngineerOne,FleetDevices: Import + Staged Rollout
    SecurityEngineerOne->>KMS: ImportKey (public_key)
    alt kms_import_failed
        KMS--xSecurityEngineerOne: error
        SecurityEngineerOne->>PostgreSQL: INSERT key_rotation_log {status='rolled_back'}
        Note over SecurityEngineerOne: PagerDuty page on-call
    else success
        KMS-->>SecurityEngineerOne: new_key_id
    end
    SecurityEngineerOne->>OtaService: trigger FW update with new pubkey in trust list (staged over 2 weeks)
    OtaService->>FleetDevices: staged rollout — must reach 100%
    alt fleet_adoption_below_threshold (< 100%)
        Note over SecurityEngineerOne: hold ceremony — wait for laggards or skip-and-revoke unhealthy devices
    end

    Note over SecurityEngineerOne,FleetDevices: Activate + Overlap (90 days)
    SecurityEngineerOne->>YubiHSM: begin signing OTA manifests with new key
    Note over FleetDevices: tjtjboth keys accepted for 90 days (overlap window)
    SecurityEngineerOne->>FleetDevices: FW update — remove old key from trust list (after overlap)

    SecurityEngineerOne->>PostgreSQL: INSERT key_rotation_log {secret_name='ota_signing_key', rotation_method='manual', status='completed', notes='ceremony log + S3 legal hold'}
    SecurityEngineerOne->>SecurityEngineerOne: store signed ceremony log in S3 (legal hold)

    Note over SecurityEngineerOne,PostgreSQL: annual ceremony · timeout weeks · rotation_failed_rollback → revert to AWSPREVIOUS, page on-call, no auto-retry
